Any way to levitate and you can go above the trap doors or over the
moat around the back.  Magical breathing and you can walk under
water around the back.

If you have a few boulders there's a high risk method.  Search
VERY carefully to see how many trap doors there are.  Push one
boulder fewer to plug all of the doors but one.  If there's only one
trapdoor left and you have a boulder near it, smash that boulder
into rocks because if the boulder plugs the last trapdoor it will be
MUCH harder to go deeper.  The point here is that stepping on a
trap doesn't always work.  Every several tries you escape the
trap.  And in this case walk calmly towards the up stairs and
start looking for levitation.



